21
00:01:24,960 --> 00:01:25,850
The earth will save itself.

22
00:01:26,730 --> 00:01:28,790
It survived the worst disasters in the past.

23
00:01:29,280 --> 00:01:32,160
I mean, honestly, we live in the boonies.

24
