My house is 40 years old and it would take a lot of money to get it refitted to be green and energy efficient.

27
00:01:45,930 --> 00:01:54,050
Well, I don't really know if I believe in global warming either or whether or not it was our doing or a natural change the earth is going through.

28
00:01:54,670 --> 00:01:58,450
But you have to admit that we're living pretty irresponsibly here in the West.

29
00:01:58,910 --> 00:01:59,350
I guess.

30
00:01:59,930 --> 00:02:01,570
I think the issue at hand is sustainability.

31
00:02:02,570 --> 00:02:13,990
We've only got this one earth we can live on and our resources are quickly disappearing because of our own carelessness and our inability to think of anyone but ourselves and anything but the present.

32
00:02:14,690 --> 00:02:18,450
So like I was saying, we need to change the way we live.

33
00:02:18,730 --> 00:02:20,810
We need to reduce our carbon footprint.

34
00:02:21,370 --> 00:02:23,010
But it doesn't have to be that drastic.

35
00:02:23,970 --> 00:02:28,050
Hybrid vehicles and solar panels are too expensive to be feasible right now.

36
